---------------------------------------------------------------------------
PARITY MAPPING (web → native)
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  data:   ChartDataPoint slice { time, power } + DriveStats { powerMax, powerMin,
            avgPower } → PowerProfileSample { index, time, powerW } (SI floor: power
            kept in watts, kW derived only at the chart boundary per ADR-009 / the SI
            cutover + the PowerOutputChart precedent) + PowerProfileStats
            { powerMaxW, powerMinW, avgPowerW } (web passes `stats` as a prop, so the
            surface receives them rather than recomputing).
  power:   web `power` is kW already (parent pre-divides); native carries SI watts and
            converts power_w/1000 in the pure projection (PowerProfileProjection.points
            / .summaryKw), keeping the source contract SI-canonical.
  shell:   <FadeIn><ChartContainer title="Power Profile" ariaLabel height=220> →
            TSFadeIn(0.2) + tokenized glass card (Color.TS.surface + TSRadius.lg +
            Color.TS.border), header (bolt glyph + title + freshness chip).
  chart:   Recharts AreaChart — <Area dataKey="power" stroke/fill #f59e0b> from a y=0
            baseline + <ReferenceLine y=0> + CartesianGrid + XAxis(time,
            preserveStartEnd) + YAxis + <Tooltip ChartTooltip> + synced reference line
            (syncedX) → Swift Charts Chart{ AreaMark(yStart:0,yEnd:power, amber
            gradient) + LineMark(power stroke width 2) + RuleMark(y=0, dashed) +
            cursor RuleMark + tooltip }. X is the sample index with start/end time
            labels (web interval="preserveStartEnd"); Y reads kW; valueDomain always
            spans 0 so the regen area below zero stays visible.
  colors:  web amber #f59e0b → Color.TS.chartSeriesEnergy (value-exact #f59e0b,
            adaptive light/dark/contrast); Max Regen cyan-400 → Color.TS.chartSeriesRegen;
            Avg → Color.TS.textPrimary; y=0 rule → Color.TS.textMuted (web
            rgba(255,255,255,0.15)).
  cursor:  useSyncedCursor (broadcast onMouseMove) + useSyncedReferenceLineX (read
            syncedX) → PowerProfileCursorSync seam (the shared drive-detail cursor):
            .chartXSelection broadcasts the local hover via model.updateCursor; the
            RuleMark + tooltip follow model.cursorIndex, so a sibling chart's hover
            moves this surface's reference line too (bidirectional, tested).
  tip:     <Tooltip content={<ChartTooltip/>}> → PowerProfileTooltip via the RuleMark
            annotation (time + Power X kW).
  stats:   web row `Max Power: fmtInt(powerMax) kW · Max Regen: fmtInt(powerMin) kW ·
            Avg: fmtNumber(avgPower) kW` → PowerProfileStatRow (amber / cyan / neutral;
            fmtInt = intString 0-dp, fmtNumber = decimalString at the configurable
            precision). Shown only in the content phase (web `chartData.length > 1`).
  empty:   web `chartData.length > 1 ? <chart+stats> : <Activity glyph + "No telemetry
            data available">` → resolvePhase threshold (> 1) + PowerProfileEmpty
            (ContentUnavailableView, waveform.path.ecg). Never a blank box.
  i18n:    every t(key,default) from source resolved through PowerProfileStrings facade
            (table "PowerProfileChart"); the 7 source keys (powerProfile, .aria, power,
            noChartData, maxPower, maxRegen, avgLabel) + units/axis/state scaffolding,
            fallbacks identical to the web strings, so no English literal ships in code.

STATES (every one renders — no hidden surface):
  loading  → PowerProfileLoadingChart (TSSkeleton chart block + stat row; reduce-motion)
  content  → PowerProfileAreaChart (amber area + y=0 line + synced cursor + tooltip) +
             PowerProfileStatRow (Max Power / Max Regen / Avg)
  empty    → PowerProfileEmpty (web "No telemetry data available") — never blank
  error    → PowerProfileError (QueryError-equiv, Retry → model.refresh())
  stale    → freshness chip (Stale) + connectivity banner + one guarded auto-refresh
  offline  → freshness chip (Offline) + banner; keeps the cached trace, no refetch
a11y: container summary (title + sample count + max/regen/avg kW), chart aria label +
  spoken summary value, per-sample cursor label, stat-row + chip combined labels,
  reduce-motion animation gate, Dynamic Type via system fonts/tokens. The web chart
  opts out of a per-sample table (its `chart-a11y:no-table` marker); native matches
  that with a concise spoken summary rather than reading every sample.
telemetry: P1/S11 view.opened(surface:"PowerProfileChart") emitted once on appear.

